Modifications:
- Added strlcpy.c
- src/ has only the upstream files Chromium builds, plus NOTICE; Android.bp,
  libsync.map.txt, OWNERS and tests/ are not imported.
- src/include/sync/sync.h is a copy of src/include/android/sync.h; upstream
  has a symlink there, which Crowbar cannot import.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from
this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
